<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.6.2">
<l>aṅkoru kūṟai yaraikkuṭup pataṉā caiyāl</l>
<l>maṅkiya māṉiṭa cātiyiṉ pēriṭumā tarkāḷ</l>
<l>ceṅkaṇe ṭumāl cirītarā veṉṟaḻait takkāl</l>
<l>naṅkaikāḷ nāraṇaṉ tamaṉṉai narakam pukāḷ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Fools give the names of the decaying human species</l>
<l rend="indent">[to your children] because of the desire to wear a loin cloth,</l>
<l>Ladies! [But] if [you] call out, “Red Eyed Tall Māl! Śrīdhara!”,</l>
<l rend="indent">the mother of Nāraṇa will not go to hell.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
